\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是降幅、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是原价。这个式子揭示了一个反直觉的结论：<strong>高价商品的单位预算效率天然低</strong>（分母大），因此在预算紧张时，同样的钱用于中低价商品能清掉更多库存。这与&quot;优先清高价值货&quot;的直觉相反，取舍取决于目标是&quot;清件数&quot;还是&quot;回笼资金&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与促销预算的区别\">与促销预算的区别</h3><p>清仓降价预算与促销活动预算不是一回事：促销预算买的是<strong>增量销量</strong>（在正常销售之上的提升），清仓预算买的是<strong>库存出清</strong>（把必然要处理的货换成现金）。混用两者会导致预算归属混乱，也会让复盘时无法判断&quot;这笔钱花得值不值&quot;。两者的协同问题在 <a href=\"../markdown-ops-metric/promo-competitor-price-coordination\">与促销引擎/竞品价协同</a> 展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>清仓的目标是&quot;在可接受亏损内最快回笼资金&quot;，而非&quot;清掉库存&quot;；决策标尺应使用<strong>贡献毛利</strong>（扣除履约与退货成本）而非销售毛利。</li>\n<li>回收率底线随品类与时间变化，与之比较的对手是&quot;持有成本 + 过时风险 + 仓储排挤效应&quot;；已全额计提跌价的批次，只要售价高于处置成本就应卖出。</li>\n<li>法律要求&quot;先前价格&quot;是降价前不少于 30 天窗口内的最低价，因此系统必须保存带时间戳的价格变更流水，且划线价不能反复使用最初原价。</li>\n<li>结构化数据中 <code>price</code> 是常规价、<code>sale_price</code> 是促销价，两者必须与落地页一致（<a href=\"https://schema.org/Offer\">schema.org Offer</a>、<a href=\"https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/6324471\">Google Merchant Center</a>）；划线价与 feed 口径漂移是最常见的合规缺陷。</li>\n<li>品牌价格保护是跨期资产问题，手段分渠道隔离、受众隔离、时间隔离三类；渠道隔离必须确保隔离渠道不被公开搜索到。</li>\n<li>降价计划必须经过<strong>合同价格政策校验层</strong>，被拦截项需人工例外审批。</li>\n<li>预算约束下的最优分配按<strong>边际效率</strong>排序，与&quot;优先清高价货&quot;的直觉相反。</li>\n<li>渠道层面的落地见 <a href=\"../clearance-channels/outlet-zone-search-exposure\">站内 outlet 专区与搜索曝光</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"清仓毛利回收与品牌价格保护","id":"清仓毛利回收与品牌价格保护"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"毛利回收的计算口径","id":"毛利回收的计算口径"},{"level":3,"text":"三个不同的\"毛利\"","id":"三个不同的-毛利"},{"level":3,"text":"回收率底线与处置阈值","id":"回收率底线与处置阈值"},{"level":3,"text":"与跌价准备的联动","id":"与跌价准备的联动"},{"level":2,"text":"降价的法律与合规边界","id":"降价的法律与合规边界"},{"level":3,"text":"\"原价\"必须可证明","id":"原价-必须可证明"},{"level":3,"text":"划线价与结构化数据的一致性","id":"划线价与结构化数据的一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"品牌价格保护","id":"品牌价格保护"},{"level":3,"text":"价格形象是跨期的资产","id":"价格形象是跨期的资产"},{"level":3,"text":"渠道隔离的工程要求","id":"渠道隔离的工程要求"},{"level":3,"text":"与渠道价格政策的冲突","id":"与渠道价格政策的冲突"},{"level":2,"text":"预算与容量约束下的回收优化","id":"预算与容量约束下的回收优化"},{"level":3,"text":"降价预算是一次性资源","id":"降价预算是一次性资源"},{"level":3,"text":"与促销预算的区别","id":"与促销预算的区别"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"stock-to-go 与清仓曲线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-lifecycle-markdown-pricing/markdown-decision-optimization/stock-to-go-clearance-curve"},"next":{"title":"站内 outlet 专区与搜索曝光（联017）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-lifecycle-markdown-pricing/clearance-channels/outlet-zone-search-exposure"}}